# Touch Mode (#178, #222; docs/steps/2026-11-18-ready-222.md) on the agents' Duo (iOS 27.1): the Settings panel at its
# row (Direct Touch, then Trackpad), sideways and upright, large type; the tour's picture card in Trackpad mode (the
# Duo's an iPhone's: no Pencil row); and the stream screen in Trackpad mode, which must be main's pixel for pixel (the
# pad over the picture draws nothing). Main ignores -Sill.touchMode and -SillSettingsScroll touch.
#   Scripts/harness-photos.sh Scripts/harness-photos/touch-mode-duo.cases --baseline origin/main
duo-touch-direct        -SillLayout 951x669 -SillHinge flat -SillSettings 1 -SillSettingsScroll touch
duo-touch-trackpad      -SillLayout 951x669 -SillHinge flat -SillSettings 1 -SillSettingsScroll touch -Sill.touchMode trackpad
duo-touch-ax3           -SillLayout 951x669 -SillHinge flat -SillSettings 1 -SillSettingsScroll touch -Sill.touchMode trackpad -UIPreferredContentSizeCategoryName UICTContentSizeCategoryAccessibilityXL
duo-upright-trackpad    -SillLayout 669x951 -SillHinge flat -SillSettings 1 -SillSettingsScroll touch -Sill.touchMode trackpad
duo-tour-trackpad       -SillLayout 951x669 -SillHinge flat -SillTourState fresh -SillTour touch -Sill.touchMode trackpad --wait=6
duo-stream-trackpad     -SillLayout 951x669 -SillHinge flat -Sill.touchMode trackpad
